## Endpoints

### Data Read (11)
- `GET /{id}` — Get data for a specific ID.
- `GET /api/widgets/{widgetId}` — Get details for a specific widget.
- `GET /api/widgets/v1/provider_profiles` — Get provider profiles for widgets.
- `GET /custom-fonts/api/v1/company-fonts/onsite` — Get onsite company fonts.
- `GET /forms/api/v7/VgSk8v/full-forms` — Get full forms data.
- `GET /pagead/conversion/{conversionId}/` — Get conversion data for a specific conversion ID.
- `GET /pay/{payId}` — Get payment details for a specific payment ID.
- `GET /products/{productId}` — Get details for a specific product.
- `GET /public/store` — Get public store information.
- `GET /user/claimed-rewards/all` — Get all claimed rewards for the user.
- `GET /users/{userId}` — Get details for a specific user.

### Data Write (8)
- `POST /.well-known/shopify/monorail/unstable/produce_batch` — Submit a batch of production data (Shopify Monorail).
- `POST /{id}` — Post data to a specific ID.
- `POST /a/elevar` — Send data to Elevar.
- `POST /api/unstable/graphql.json` — Send GraphQL queries to read/write data in the tryskymd system.
- `POST /launcher/{launcherId}` — Post data to a specific launcher endpoint.
- `POST /shopify_pay/accelerated_checkout` — Initiate an accelerated checkout with Shopify Pay.
- `POST /unstable/produce_batch` — Submit a batch of production data.
- `POST /v1/{v1Id}` — Post data to a specific v1 endpoint.

### Media (1)
- `GET /cdn/shopifycloud/storefront/assets/storefront/{storefrontJwt}` — Retrieve a storefront asset using a JWT.

### Realtime (1)
- `POST /launcher/events/v2` — Report launcher events in realtime to tryskymd.

### Config (1)
- `GET /user/settings` — Get the user's settings.

