- **Auth headers:** 4 (sec-fetch-storage-access, bugsnag-api-key, x-shopify-storefront-access-token, x-alia-jwt)
- **Session cookies:** 30

If auth expires, re-run `unbrowse_login` or `unbrowse_capture` to refresh tokens.

